<title>GERMANY: Baden-Wuertt.Dec CPI up 0.2 pct m/m, up 1.2 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Baden-Wuertt.Dec CPI up 0.2 pct m/m, up 1.2 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The state statistics office in the German state of Baden-Wuerttemberg reported the following consumer price changes for December.</p>
<p>    Cost of living		December	    November</p>
<p>    Month/month (pct change)  +0.2		  -0.1</p>
<p>    Year/year		     +1.2		  +1.3</p>
<p>NOTE - This data is later combined with data from three other major German states to calculate the preliminary inflation figure for the whole of west Germany.</p>
</text>
